{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-014",
    "title": "第二盏灯"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_074",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "守灯人沉默片刻：“她把铜环交给我，要我守住第二盏灯。她说若有一天顾家的人来，不要让她点灯。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第四声敲击之后，镇子重新安静下来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2116,
          "end": 2116
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "客舍外的脚印没有继续靠近，也没有离开。它停在门槛前，像一个守规矩的客人，等屋里的人先开口。白发老妇坐在墙角，双手交叠在木杖上，嘴唇紧抿，不再回答任何问题。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2118,
          "end": 2118
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把小灯盏放在桌下，用衣布盖住。他不敢点灯，也不敢触碰墙上那条不断延伸的青线。顾长离则守在门边，铜针尖端对着门缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2120,
          "end": 2120
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说有人回来过。”陆照临压低声音，“是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2122,
          "end": 2122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇闭着眼：“我说过吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2124,
          "end": 2124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“说过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2126,
          "end": 2126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就是我记错了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2128,
          "end": 2128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向墙上山水画：“这里的人都会记错？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2130,
          "end": 2130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇睁开眼：“记错比记得安全。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2132,
          "end": 2132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外忽然响起一阵轻刮声，像湿手指沿着门板慢慢划过。陆照临掌心残印一凉，墙上的青线立刻停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2134,
          "end": 2134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它来了。”老妇说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2136,
          "end": 2136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2138,
          "end": 2138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不该跟随的引路人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2140,
          "end": 2140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门缝下的影子没有脚，却一点点漫进屋里。影子先是细长的一条，随后分成三股，分别指向陆照临、顾长离和桌下的小灯盏。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2142,
          "end": 2142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离甩出铜针。铜针穿过影子，钉在门槛上，影子随即缩回门外。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2144,
          "end": 2144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能挡一会儿。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2146,
          "end": 2146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2148,
          "end": 2148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇指向客舍后墙：“后面有一间旧屋，三年前那三个人住过。屋里没有灯，影子不敢进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2150,
          "end": 2150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是说镇里没有井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2152,
          "end": 2152
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没说没有屋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2154,
          "end": 2154
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们从后窗翻出客舍。雨已经停了，街上却比下雨时更湿，屋檐和石板都泛着一层青光。镇民家门紧闭，门缝里塞着灰泥，有些门板上画着半盏灯，有些则把灯纹全部刮掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2156,
          "end": 2156
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "旧屋在镇子最深处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2158,
          "end": 2158
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "屋门歪斜，门楣刻着“借宿”二字。顾长离推门时，门轴发出一声长响。屋内只有一张木床和三只空碗，墙上钉着一幅破旧的路线图。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2160,
          "end": 2160
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "路线图从玄霄宗开始，途经旧驿道，最后停在一处被黑墨涂掉的地点。图旁写着三个人名，前两个只剩姓氏，第三个完整可辨：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2162,
          "end": 2162
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走近墙面，呼吸变得急促。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2164,
          "end": 2164
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你父亲的字？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2166,
          "end": 2166
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我见过他的灯账，不记得字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2168,
          "end": 2168
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你又忘了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2170,
          "end": 2170
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。他伸手靠近路线图，掌心青痕立即浮起。图上被涂黑的地点渗出水迹，黑墨顺着纸纹向下流，露出两个字：归井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2172,
          "end": 2172
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2174,
          "end": 2174
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是影子的刮擦，而是真正的脚步。有人踩过街上的积水，停在旧屋前。随后，一个沙哑的声音响起：“屋里有人吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2176,
          "end": 2176
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把路线图揭下，卷进袖中。陆照临将三只空碗扣在桌上，假装他们只是借宿的过客。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2178,
          "end": 2178
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门被推开一条缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2180,
          "end": 2180
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "站在门外的是一名中年妇人，脸上有一道旧烧痕。她看见陆照临手里的普通引路灯，眼神立刻变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2182,
          "end": 2182
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们从哪里来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2184,
          "end": 2184
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北边。”顾长离答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2186,
          "end": 2186
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北边哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2188,
          "end": 2188
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不问名字，也不问路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2190,
          "end": 2190
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人愣了一下，随即笑了：“你们知道规矩。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2192,
          "end": 2192
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她推门进来，手里提着一只空篮。篮底压着几片晒干的灰色叶子，叶脉排列成半枚残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2194,
          "end": 2194
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，也有三个人住在这里。”妇人说，“他们带着一盏灯，灯里没有火。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2196,
          "end": 2196
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人立刻闭嘴，将篮子塞进顾长离怀里：“别让它拿走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2222,
          "end": 2222
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它是什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2224,
          "end": 2224
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“忘记名字之后留下的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2226,
          "end": 2226
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有点灯，灯却自行发出极低的嗡鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2230,
          "end": 2230
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门板在这时彻底裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2238,
          "end": 2238
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人摇头：“追他们的是忘记他们的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2380,
          "end": 2380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "仓房外忽然传来一声空灯撞击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2382,
          "end": 2382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人把完整的引路灯递给陆照临：“第二盏灯照活人。你若点亮它，镇上所有仍活着的人都会看见自己忘掉的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2384,
          "end": 2384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2386,
          "end": 2386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会先看见自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2388,
          "end": 2388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有接。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2390,
          "end": 2390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不点灯，它还能带路吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2392,
          "end": 2392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能。只是路会带你去它想去的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2394,
          "end": 2394
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到灯旁，指着灯座：“这不是无灯镇的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2396,
          "end": 2396
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前有人把它留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2398,
          "end": 2398
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“姓顾的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2400,
          "end": 2400
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人沉默片刻：“她把铜环交给我，要我守住第二盏灯。她说若有一天顾家的人来，不要让她点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2402,
          "end": 2402
        }
      }
    ],
